# --- Razer proprietary material: never commit ---------------------------------------------------
# Official updaters, their extracted contents and the firmware inside them
**/stock/
# Flash/EEPROM dumps (Razer firmware/bootloader, device serial numbers)
**/dumps/
**/recovery/
# Decompiled/disassembled Razer code and Ghidra projects (they embed the binaries)
**/re/updater/CustomerFWU2Point5/
**/re/updater/*_decompiled.c
**/re/updater/ghidra/
**/re/firmware/ghidra_proj/
**/re/firmware/decomp_*
**/re/firmware/listing_*
**/re/firmware/hexdump_*
**/re/firmware/tables_*
**/re/firmware/qmk_snippets_*
*.gpr
*.rep/
# Vendor register description files (download from the vendor / cmsis-svd)
*.svd

